WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.400
The industry runs on certificates.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.300
A PDF says "finished." What a job needs is "can build."
Hiring managers know the difference — so do you.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:22.600
So we don't hand out certificates. Every lesson ends in a proof:
a real check, a passing test you wrote, a working artifact anyone can run.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.400
Your credential is a link anyone can verify.

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:36.400
Forget the certificate. Ship the proof.
